phic xlink:href="AU2008-685897.001"/></fig><fig id="fig2" position="float"><label>Figure 2</label><caption><p>A case of True Hermaphrodite with (a) well-developed phallusand right scrotal ovotestis gonad, and (b) penoscrotal hypospadias and severechordee.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="AU2008-685897.002"/></fig><fig id="fig3" position="float"><label>Figure 3</label><caption><p>(a) A case of true hermaphrodite with  right scrotal ovotestis and left undescended gonad needing a prosthesis. (b) Indeginized (DK Gupta) testicular prosthesismade of Teflon.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="AU2008-685897.003"/></fig></floats-wrap></article>